BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Salsa/Bachata/Kizomba GTA
UID:event_314762683@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260602T043610Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260601T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260602T010000
SUMMARY:Fuego Bachata Sensual Mondays
DESCRIPTION:Salsa | Bachata | Kizomba GTA\n* 💥 Fuego Bachata Sensual Mo
 ndays💥\n\nStart your week with flavor\, rhythm\, and good vibes! 🌶
 💃🕺\nEnjoy amazing food\, fun lessons\, and non-stop Latin dancing al
 l night long!\n\n📍 Tehranto Restaurant – 5625 Yonge St\, North York\n
 \n🚇 Finch Subway \\| 🅿 Free Parking\n\n🍽 Full Kitchen + Bar Speci
 als Open Late\n\n🎟 $10 Cover (includes Lesson)\n\n🕘 9PM Bachata Less
 on – Guest Instructor\n\n🎶 DJ Geronimo heating up the floor with the 
 best Salsa\, Bachata & Latin beats all night!\n\nCome for the lessons\, st
 ay for the dancing — Mondays just got HOT! 🔥\n\nBest way to get a hol
 d of us is through WhatsApp:\nhttps://chat.whatsapp.com/KpFOsXEuXRWB7uOYor
 JNPU
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/salsa-bachata-kizomba-gta/events/3147
 62683/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260513T012419Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260513T012419Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Salsa/Bachata/Kizomba GTA
UID:event_314835398@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260602T043610Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260606T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260606T190000
SUMMARY:FREE LESSON - Saturday Salsa Matinee | Toronto
DESCRIPTION:Salsa | Bachata | Kizomba GTA\nBest way to get a hold of us is
  on our [WhatsApp chat](https://chat.whatsapp.com/KpFOsXEuXRWB7uOYorJNPU)\
 , also great way to join a community of amazing like-minded people :)\n\nC
 anada SBK brings you a Saturday afternoon salsa social in the heart of Tor
 onto at the warm and cozy space of Trinity St. Paul church.\nAdmission inc
 ludes:\nDJ Geronimo's top Salsa\, Bachata & Cha cha Latin hits.\n\nIt's an
  excellent opportunity to practice and improve your dance to the tunes of 
 world Salsa music by DJ Geronimo and guest DJs. Have a favourite song ? We
 're also accepting music requests\nAtmosphere: Friendly and Laid back.\n\n
 Dancers of all levels are welcome for social (No partner required)\nDoor: 
 $10\n\nFREE LESSON (with admission to social dancing) 3:30pm\n\nSOCIAL DAN
 CING 4:30pm-7:30pm\n\\*Please check calendar as in some rare occasions tim
 e changes slightly\n\nPlease check calendar as in some rare occasions time
  changes slightly\nSocial dancing\n\nVenue: Trinity St. Paul Church\, Bloo
 r St. W\, Toronto\nBring your own beverage and snacks\n\nEveryone is welco
 me!\nJoin our WhatsApp group:\n[https://chat.whatsapp.com/Kj63TzHIqYL5hPrR
 JolhyD](https://chat.whatsapp.com/KpFOsXEuXRWB7uOYorJNPU)\n\nHosts:\n\nMay
 a & Gary\nCanada SBK (Formerly TSF)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/salsa-bachata-kizomba-gta/events/3148
 35398/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260517T200215Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T200215Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Salsa/Bachata/Kizomba GTA
UID:event_314853019@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260602T043610Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260607T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260607T223000
SUMMARY:Baila in the West Sunday Social
DESCRIPTION:Salsa | Bachata | Kizomba GTA\nBest way to get a hold of us is
  on our [WhatsApp chat](https://chat.whatsapp.com/Kj63TzHIqYL5hPrRJolhyD)\
 , also great way to join a community of amazing like-minded people :)\n\n*
 **Let's Dance!***\n***¡Vamos a bailar!***\n\n***DJ Geronimo 🎧 will be 
 playing your favorite Salsa 🎵 Bachata 🎶 Chacha 🎵 Merengue hits 
 🔊 DJ Sweetlike will be jamming in the Kizomba room***\n\nCover $10 befo
 re 7pm - $15 after 7pm - includes:\n***Free Bachata Lesson at 6:15pm with 
 entrance to event***\n***Dancing til 10pm***\n\n***\\*Casual dress code***
 \n***\\*Bring your own refreshments***\n\n***👠Please wear comfortable &
  clean shoes👞***\n\n**Location:**\n📍 40 Stavebank Rd N — Port Cred
 it Memorial Arena
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/salsa-bachata-kizomba-gta/events/3148
 53019/
